[3.085684,"o","Veasel Code 0.69.6-next.0\r\n\r\nCommands:\r\n  veasel         Start or reuse the local V backend, then open the TUI\r\n  serve          Start the local V backend only\r\n  tui            Start the TUI, starting the backend if needed\r\n  run            Run a task non-interactively in a persisted session\r\n  mcp            List or manage configured MCP servers (user/project scope)\r\n  plugins        Enable or disable Agent Plugin skill/MCP components\r\n  config         Show or update local model provider settings\r\n  worktrees      List, add, remove, lock, unlock, or prune git worktrees\r\n  skills         List discovered standalone SKILL.md packages\r\n\r\nOptions:\r\n  --help, -h       Show this help\r\n  --version, -v    Show the product version\r\n\r\nEnvironment: VEASEL_PORT, VEASEL_DATA_DIR, VEASEL_PLUGIN_DIR\r\n\r\nExamples:\r\n  veasel\r\n  veasel serve\r\n  veasel tui\r\n  veasel run --prompt \"Explain this codebase\"\r\n  veasel mcp list\r\n  veasel mcp add stdio echo-tools true\r\n  veasel plugins components list\r\n  veasel plugins components disable demo mcp local\r\n  veasel plugins links list\r\n  veasel config model get\r\n  veasel config model set --provider meta --max-output-tokens 8192\r\n  veasel worktrees list\r\n  veasel skills list\r\n  veasel --version\r\n"]
